TITLE Calcite kinetic dissolution in hydrothermal solution
SOLUTION 1
    temp 100
    pH   5
    pe   4
    units mol/kgw
    C(4) 5e-4
    Mn   1e-3

KINETICS 1
    Calcite
        -m0 1.0
        -m  1.0
        -parms 10.0 0.001
        -tol 1e-12
    -steps 10 in 100

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file sel.txt
    -reset false
    -time true
    -step true
    -totals C
END
